    "postalCode": {
      "label": "LCNN  NNN",
      "required": true,
      "usage": "Use integral LC, two district digits, two literal spaces and three post-office/community digits only with a current Saint Lucia Postal Service assignment. The 2015 official table contains 54 normalized delivery-point codes; LC04  113 is a home-delivery address example, not a row in that table. Delivery points may be post offices, private letter boxes, residential or business addresses and are not necessarily areas. Do not turn offices, mailboxes, communities, districts, quarters, administrative boundaries, parcels, buildings, addresses, Points, buffers, hulls, cells or models into postal areas. Derived or virtual geometry requires an explicit competent-authority postcode crosswalk, compatible rights, edition, CRS, topology, method, confidence and exceptions. Building display requires a separately rights-cleared civic-address identity, building identity and explicit relation. AGID remains an independent spatial index."
